veloping an affinity with Paul Mullin.</summary></entry><entry><title>'I'm an Olympic champion - but my passion is art'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm78pz2d0vqno#2</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T05:57:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm78pz2d0vqno--32f9c0370173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm78pz2d0vqno?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Emily Craig from Pembury, who became an Olympic champion in 2024, says she loves her life now.</summary></entry><entry><title>Dog gatecrashes wedding as bride and groom look on</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw23d3xx833eo#2</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T05:59:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw23d3xx833eo--3cbd4ba06227.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw23d3xx833eo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Simon and Amy were about to tie the knot when a passing Jack Russell interrupted the wedding</summary></entry><entry><title>How much art does your council own and is it locked away or on display?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crgqwgzxeexno#3</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:00Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T14:43:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crgqwgzxeexno--3e745240a6dc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crgqwgzxeexno?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">More than 500,000 pieces of art are owned by 225 councils, the BBC finds, but most of it is storage.</summary></entry><entry><title>Drugs running was like 'a paper round' for exploited son, mum says</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgl78y523lzo#3</id><updated>2026-11-13T06: